    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46408" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">suf-fervēfăcĭo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subf-</span></b> ), no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>,
				factum, 3, v. a., <i>to
				heat</i> or <i>warm from below</i> (Plinian),
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				18, 11, 26, § 104</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">affirmant, lapillos, qui sufferveflant, rumpi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					27, 9, 51, § 75</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aceti heminis quinque suffervefactis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					14, 17, 21, § 114</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">semuncia amyli cum ovo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					22, 25, 67, § 137</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">37, 10, 54,
				§ 142</span></i>.</div>
